---
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import Install from "../components/Install.astro";
import RoundTrip from "../components/RoundTrip.astro";
import Uses from "../components/Uses.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#173b39" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/kalam-latin-400-normal.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin />
    <meta name="description" content="Switchback is a skill for your AI agent. It prints a page for what you're working on; you work it with a pen, send a photo, and your agent carries on from what you wrote." />
    <title>Switchback | Step away from the agents. Think it through on paper.</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <Fragment set:html={`<!--
THESIS: Show the loop instead of naming it: one everyday request, a talk, followed from chat to paper to reply. Refuses the feature-grid tool landing page.
OWN-WORLD: Contour Return. Real Sani Pass relief in forest green #173b39 / #0f2826, trail-ochre #d1a34b dashed routes, white printed pages carrying Kalam handwriting in pen blue, red and highlighter; Besley headings, Inter text, spaced-caps map labels.
STORY: The visitor learns it is an agent skill that prints a page, sees the marks and the reply, learns what each pen means in plain words, sees what it is for, installs.
FIRST VIEWPORT: Headline and lede on the dark plateau at left; the marked page centre-right, tilted; the request bubble above-left with a trail into the page; a return trail to the reply card at right; ochre Install button under the lede.
FORM: Pinned by the user: the approved Contour Return comp, .impeccable/mocks/decision/contour-return.png. No seed roll (pinned).
FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance
-->`} />
    <Hero />
    <main>
      <RoundTrip />
      <Uses />
      <Install />
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
